# shadcn/ui is mandatory

All user-facing UI in this project must use **shadcn/ui** from `@/components/ui/*`.

- Buttons, inputs, selects, cards, tables, dialogs, nav, forms, badges, alerts: shadcn only.
- Missing primitive → `npx shadcn@latest add <component>`, then use it.
- Do not invent per-feature themes, raw Tailwind control styling, or other UI kits.
- Demo/test pages follow the same rule.

See `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/skills/shadcn-ui/SKILL.md`.
